{
  "schema": "ehgp.v11.session_plan.v1",
  "note": "Qualification L1 + L2 de la sortie parametree (Claude, 5 octobre 2026), commit 00bd979ac : S3 (arbre d'ordre K, rattachement), S5 (api, --sortie=full, provenance), S6a/S6b (supports, assemblage), S7 (--sortie=supports, MHGP11SP). D'abord la mesure appariee de la regle de L2 sur machine au repos (FULL 16379 contre supports 7035, trames ng00-02, W1 et W48, trois prises, ng00 a K10 descriptif), puis la matrice complete (budget 2200 s).",
  "python_packages": "none",
  "default_build": true,
  "results_cap_bytes": 134217728,
  "commands": [
    {
      "name": "mesure_l2",
      "timeout_seconds": 1200,
      "argv": ["python3", "{src}/morsehgp3D_v11/bench/sorties_g4.py", "--cli", "{build}/mhgp11", "--data-dir", "{data}",
               "--fils", "1,48", "--prises", "3", "--k10", "ng00", "--commit", "00bd979ac", "--work", "{build}/mesure",
               "--out", "{out}/sorties_g4.json", "--timeout", "1100"]
    },
    {
      "name": "matrice",
      "timeout_seconds": 2300,
      "argv": ["python3", "{src}/morsehgp3D_v11/tools/g4_matrix.py", "--src", "{src}", "--out", "{out}", "--data", "{data}",
               "--work", "{build}/matrix", "--budget-seconds", "2200"]
    }
  ]
}
